TITLE Falcon5 Propulsion Deck

Thrust available and fuel flow tables for turbojet engine
Idle thrust and fuel flow tables
MAC (Mean Aero Cord), 
    this is the c.g. shift as a function of aircraft weight
    -> table not used, rather MAC given in input.asc called 'mac' as three integer: 30, 35, 40

    MAC vs mass(kg)
    9786    0.4198
    10567   0.3293
    11142   0.3055
    11660   0.3171
    14247   0.3066

Note: Power on/off drag adjustments are made by the thrust calculations
Typical take-off mass  12701 kg
Typical fuel mass   4461 kg

1DIM  iff_vs_alt
NX1 5   //altitude - m; idle fuel flow - kg/s
0       0.0
3000    0.0
6000    0.0
9000    0.0
12000   0.0

